      "note": "The table logs the history of the spending of users that make purchases from an online shopping website that has a desktop and a mobile application.\n(user_id, spend_date, platform) is the primary key (combination of columns with unique values) of this table.\nThe platform column is an ENUM (category) type of ('desktop', 'mobile').",
